{"title":"Gold","sourceTitle":"Gold/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Gold\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Gold (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Gold/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Oro (2% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Gold/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Or (7% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Gold/it\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Oro (2% translated)\" lang=\"it\" dir=\"ltr\">italiano</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Gold/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Золото (100% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Gold/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"金 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Gold/ja\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"金 (100% translated)\" lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\">日本語</a></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"center\" style=\"background-color: #eee; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 4px; border-color: #88acf5; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 85%; width: 90%; padding: 0.2em; margin: 0.5em auto; margin-left:0px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; align-items: center; padding-left: 10px\">\n<div style=\"margin-left: 10px; text-align: left;\">\n<p>Esta página foi verificada pela última vez para a versão do Vintage Story <b>1.20.9</b>.\n</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Lingote de ouro</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ingot-gold.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/6/6d/Ingot-gold.png/100px-Ingot-gold.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/6d/Ingot-gold.png/150px-Ingot-gold.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/6d/Ingot-gold.png/200px-Ingot-gold.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"TC\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Fundível</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Ponto de cheiro</b>\n</td>\n<td>1063°C\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Requer contêiner</b>\n</td>\n<td>Sim\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saída</b>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Ingot_mold\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Ingot mold\">Lingoteira</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Valor de saída</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<dl><dd><i>Consulte <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Metal\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Metal\">Metal</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Metal\" title=\"Metal\"> </a></span> para obter uma lista abrangente de todos os metais</i></dd></dl>\n<p><b>Ouro</b> é um metal raro encontrado apenas em quartzo. Seu principal uso é como componente das ligas <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bronze\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bronze\">bronze negro</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bronze\" title=\"Bronze\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Electrum\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Electrum\">electro</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Electrum\" title=\"Electrum\"> </a></span>, e como revestimento de lanternas. O ouro pode ser usado para criar ferramentas e equipamentos de Nível 2, mas essas ferramentas têm metade da durabilidade de suas contrapartes <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Copper\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Copper\">cobre</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Copper\" title=\"Copper\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Obtendo\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obtendo</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Uso\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uso</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Ligas\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ligas</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtendo\">Obtendo</span></h2>\n<dl><dd><i>Consulte <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Mining\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Mining\">Mineração</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Mining\" title=\"Mining\"> </a></span> para obter informações sobre como encontrar e extrair minérios e prospectar</i></dd></dl>\n<p>O ouro pode ser encontrado em depósitos subterrâneos como minério de ouro nativo em quartzo, raramente como pedaços de superfície que indicam a presença de um depósito abaixo, ou muito raramente através de <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/panning\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/panning\">panorâmica</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Panning\" title=\"Panning\"> </a></span> ou em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cracked_vessel\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cracked vessel\">vasos de minério rachados</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cracked_vessel\" title=\"Cracked vessel\"> </a></span>. O minério de ouro nativo requer pelo menos ferramenta de nível 3 (bronze) para ser quebrado. Certos itens de ouro também podem ser comprados no <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Trading#Luxuries\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Trading\">comerciante de luxos</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trading#Luxuries\" title=\"Trading\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Ore_Deposits#Generation_stats\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Ore Deposits\">Estatísticas de geração de depósitos</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ore_Deposits#Generation_stats\" title=\"Ore Deposits\"> </a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Minério</b></td>\n<td>Ouro Nativo\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Camada de ferramenta necessária</b></td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>E min</b></td>\n<td>N / D\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Y máx.</b></td>\n<td>N / D\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Y máximo de 256</b></td>\n<td>N / D\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Raio médio</b></td>\n<td>2 ± 2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Grossura</b></td>\n<td>2 ± 1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Gerador de disco</b></td>\n<td>Criança\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Tentativas por pedaço</b></td>\n<td>6\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Bônus de profundidade</b></td>\n<td>❌\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Tipos de pedra</b></td>\n<td>Gera dentro do quartzo com qualidade abundante\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<dl><dd><i>Para uma lista abrangente de itens que podem ser feitos de ouro, consulte o manual do jogo</i></dd></dl>\n<p>O ouro é um metal de nível 2 e pode ser usado para fabricar armaduras, ferramentas, escudos, flechas, pregos e tiras e lanternas via <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Casting\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Casting\">fundição</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Casting\" title=\"Casting\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Smithing\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Smithing\">forjando</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Smithing\" title=\"Smithing\"> </a></span>. O equipamento dourado está no mesmo nível do cobre, mas tem durabilidade significativamente menor. Isso, somado à raridade do ouro em comparação ao cobre, significa que o equipamento dourado é em grande parte ornamental. Metais mais comuns também podem ser usados ​​para fazer lanternas, pregos e tiras.\n</p><p>O uso principal do ouro é nas ligas <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bronze\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bronze\">Bronze negro</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bronze\" title=\"Bronze\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Electrum\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Electrum\">Electro</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Electrum\" title=\"Electrum\"> </a></span>, e para fazer <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Glass#Lined_Lantern\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Glass\">lanternas forradas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Glass#Lined_Lantern\" title=\"Glass\"> </a></span> por <abbr title=\"Botão direito do mouse\">usando</abbr> uma placa de ouro em uma lanterna colocada.\n</p><p>Outros usos incluem a confecção do <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Falx\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Falx\">falx de ouro</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Falx\" title=\"Falx\"> </a></span>, uma versão ornamentada da foice de aço, o reparo da armadura Forlorn Hope danificada e o uso de pepitas em algumas peças de roupa.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Estatísticas de metais\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Metal</b></td>\n<td>Ouro\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Nível</b></td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Fundição de liga&#160;%</b></td>\n<td>Ouro: 100%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>% de fundição de liga em pepitas</b></td>\n<td>Ouro: 20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Temperatura de fundição</b></td>\n<td>1063°C\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ligas\">Ligas</span></h3>\n<p>Duas ligas usam ouro no jogo, bronze negro e electrum:\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Liga\n</th>\n<th>Liga Fundida&#160;%\n</th>\n<th>% de liga fundida em pepitas\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bronze\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bronze\">Bronze negro</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bronze\" title=\"Bronze\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td><b>Ouro</b>: 8 - 16% <br /> Prata: 8 - 16% <br /> Cobre: 68 - 84%\n</td>\n<td><b>Ouro</b>: 2 <br /> Prata: 2 <br /> Cobre: 16\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Electrum\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Electrum\">Electro</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Electrum\" title=\"Electrum\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td><b>Ouro</b>: 40 - 60% <br /> Prata: 40 - 60%\n</td>\n<td><b>Ouro</b>: 8 - 12 <br /> Prata: 8 - 12\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Minérios, metais e minerais</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Guias</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Ore_Deposits/pt-br\" title=\"Ore Deposits/pt-br\">Depósitos de minério</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ore_Deposits/pt-br\" title=\"Ore Deposits/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Metal/pt-br\" title=\"Metal/pt-br\">Metais</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Metal/pt-br\" title=\"Metal/pt-br\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Metais</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #CCBCAB;\"><a href=\"/Copper/pt-br\" title=\"Copper/pt-br\">Cobre</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Copper/pt-br\" title=\"Copper/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Iron/pt-br\" title=\"Iron/pt-br\">Ferro</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Iron/pt-br\" title=\"Iron/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Meteoric_iron/pt-br\" title=\"Meteoric iron/pt-br\">Ferro meteórico</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Meteoric_iron/pt-br\" title=\"Meteoric iron/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ouro</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Silver/pt-br\" title=\"Silver/pt-br\">Prata</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Silver/pt-br\" title=\"Silver/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Lead/pt-br\" title=\"Lead/pt-br\">Chumbo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Lead/pt-br\" title=\"Lead/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Tin/pt-br\" title=\"Tin/pt-br\">Estanho</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tin/pt-br\" title=\"Tin/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Zinc/pt-br\" title=\"Zinc/pt-br\">Zinco</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Zinc/pt-br\" title=\"Zinc/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Bismuth/pt-br\" title=\"Bismuth/pt-br\">Bismuto</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bismuth/pt-br\" title=\"Bismuth/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Titanium/pt-br\" title=\"Titanium/pt-br\">Titânio (Ilmenita)</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Titanium/pt-br\" title=\"Titanium/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Nickel/pt-br\" title=\"Nickel/pt-br\">Níquel</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Nickel/pt-br\" title=\"Nickel/pt-br\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Ligas</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Bronze/pt-br\" title=\"Bronze/pt-br\">Bronze</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bronze/pt-br\" title=\"Bronze/pt-br\"> </a></span> (bronze de estanho, bronze de bismuto, bronze preto) • <a href=\"/Steel/pt-br\" title=\"Steel/pt-br\">Aço</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Steel/pt-br\" title=\"Steel/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Brass/pt-br\" title=\"Brass/pt-br\">Latão</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Brass/pt-br\" title=\"Brass/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Solder\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Solder\">Solda</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Solder\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Solder\"> </a></span> (Solda de chumbo, solda de prata) • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Molybdochalkos\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Molybdochalkos\">Molibdocalco</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Molybdochalkos\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Molybdochalkos\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cupronickel\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cupronickel\">Cuproníquel</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cupronickel\" title=\"Cupronickel\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Electrum\" ti